To pinpoint the exact cause of the issue, I will inspect the implementation of the `equals` method in `StringUtils` and the `regionMatches` method in `CharSequenceUtils`.

Let's start by examining the `equals` method in `StringUtils`:

```java
public static boolean equals(final CharSequence cs1, final CharSequence cs2) {
    if (cs1 == cs2) {
        return true;
    }
    if (cs1 == null || cs2 == null) {
        return false;
    }
    if (cs1 instanceof String && cs2 instanceof String) {
        return cs1.equals(cs2);
    }
    return CharSequenceUtils.regionMatches(cs1, false, 0, cs2, 0, Math.max(cs1.length(), cs2.length()));
}
```

