To fix this issue, it may be necessary to ensure that the `regionMatches` method handles comparisons of different-length CharSequences correctly to avoid the String Index Out of Bounds Exception.

The suspected root cause of the issue is the improper handling of different-length CharSequences in the `equals` method, particularly when utilizing `regionMatches` for comparison.

